@startuml uc002-ssd
!include ../../../diagrams/style.iuml
title UC-002 Prepare benchmark dataset: system sequence diagram

actor Developer
participant "JudgeLab" as System

note over Developer, System
  Triggered at the start of a run (UC-006),
  before any model is called.
end note

Developer -> System : load benchmark(path)
alt the file reads, parses and passes every check
  System --> Developer : benchmark(id, name, test cases in file order)
else 1a, 2a, 2b: missing file, invalid JSON or top level not an object
  System --> Developer : error(path, the one problem)
else 3a, 3b, 4a to 4d: the content breaks one or more rules
  System --> Developer : error(path, every problem, in file order)
end

note over Developer, System
  Business rule: no model is called for a
  benchmark that fails to load.
end note
@enduml
